1451
01:25:49.678 --> 01:25:52.448
Hands up. the both of you.

1452
01:25:52.615 --> 01:25:54.082
-where we can see them!
-Okay.

1453
01:25:55.684 --> 01:25:58.187
Shut the fuck up
and keep your hands in the air!

1454
01:26:14.637 --> 01:26:16.872
Hands up. both of you.
